Subject: Render Touch Bar keys wide and fit images without distortion

Keys of tb- devices get a 327x144 canvas (the Touch Bar buttons are 109x48).
Images are fitted into the canvas keeping their proportions, uploaded images
are stored with their own proportions instead of letterboxed into a square,
and the OK/alert overlays stay square.

